{
  "name": "dsh-fx-arena",
  "version": "0.10.0",
  "description": "DSH 插件：FX战士大肥鱼 —— 和大肥鱼（鲸鲸）切磋：EUR/GBP/TOKEN 对 token、黄金、鲸元五个品种，杠杆 10~500x、计时赛 90~500s，或「重生之久留美归来」：30 万本金、不限时、先摸到 2000 万赢、负债即出局（空中飞人计数）；入口在左侧图标条；一键安装器（Windows 双击 install.cmd），换机即装即用",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "scripts",
    "install.cmd",
    "install.ps1",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "fx",
    "forex",
    "game",
    "simulator"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1",
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ]
    }
  },
  "author": "koishi-fumo-code",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/koishi-fumo-code/dsh-fx-arena.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/koishi-fumo-code/dsh-fx-arena#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/koishi-fumo-code/dsh-fx-arena/issues"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node scripts/selftest.mjs",
    "register": "node scripts/install.mjs",
    "unregister": "node scripts/uninstall.mjs"
  }
}
